cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Does GenAI use impair the acquisition of visualisation literacy?
  Replication package
message: If you use this material, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Kneffel
    given-names: Bruno
abstract: >-
  Replication package for a pre-registered three-arm randomised controlled
  trial testing whether generative-AI assistance during practice impairs the
  acquisition of parallel-coordinates-plot literacy, as distinct from
  performance while that assistance is available. Contains the
  pre-registration and statistical analysis plan, the full experimental
  apparatus, the anonymised Qualtrics exports, and the analysis code.
keywords:
  - generative AI
  - cognitive offloading
  - visualisation literacy
  - randomised controlled trial
  - skill acquisition
  - pre-registered
license: CC-BY-4.0
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: https://osf.io/yw3nm
    description: OSF pre-registration
